{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-10-12 07:00:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES BRAND UNIFICATION FOR ITS RETAIL SEGMENT', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., OCT. 12, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BROWN & BROWN, INC. PROUDLY ANNOUNCES ALL BRANDS UNDER ITS RETAIL SEGMENT WILL BE UNIFIED UNDER THE BRAND NAME BROWN & BROWN AS OF JAN. 1, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2021-10-12 06:45:00', 'title': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. ANNOUNCES THE ACQUISITION OF WINSTON BENEFITS', 'text': 'DAYTONA BEACH, FLA., OCT. 12, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- J. SCOTT PENNY, CHIEF ACQUISITIONS OFFICER OF BROWN & BROWN, INC. (NYSE:BRO), AND ROBERT BRADLEY, COLIN BRADLEY AND CURRAN BRADLEY, THE PRINCIPALS OF WINSTON FINANCIAL SERVICES, INC. (“WINSTON BENEFITS”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BROWN & BROWN HAS ACQUIRED WINSTON BENEFITS.'}